monsters.urug:
A coarse and lanky orc. Urug lost her eye in a fight with a harpy, and has
sworn to slay every last one of them. Unfortunately, the vision in her
remaining eye is not very good, and she has mistaken you for one.
{{
    if you.can_smell() then
        return "She smells terrible."
    end
}}

monsters.pillar of rime:
A spire of strangely tenebrous ice, its brittle tendrils reaching skyward like
the fingers of an outstretched hand. {{
    if spells.memorised("rimeblight") then
        return "If only the dying breath of every soul could create such art."
    else
        return "It might even be beautiful if you didn't know the gruesome " ..
               "way it formed."
    end
}}

items.book of the grave:
A heavy tome of necromantic spells. Those who touch it frequently report a
palpable sense of unease, as if something unwholesome were buried between its
very pages.
{{
    if you.can_smell() then
        return "Its vellum smells faintly of dirt and decay."
    end
}}

items.book of spontaneous combustion:
A heavy tome written with wildly flammable ink. Care must be taken even opening
it, but the power of the spells described therein is undeniable.
{{
    if you.can_smell() then
        return "Its desiccated pages smell faintly of sulphur."
    end
}}

items.book of the wilderness:
A book holding lore ripped from distant and untamed lands, allowing their
denizens to be called forth to serve the reader.
{{
    if you.can_smell() then
        return "It smells distressingly musty."
    end
}}

items.eel talisman:
A strange sea fossil, adorned with abalone and pearl.
{{
    local hands = you.hand() .. "s"
    return "Causes the wearer's " .. hands
}}
to transform into a pair of wriggling electric eels that sometimes discharge
arcs of electricity through connected targets when used to strike enemies. When
the wearer's health becomes dangerously low, they will discharge an even more
violent voltage.

items.javelin:
A lightweight spear, designed for throwing. It will pass through the targets it
hits, potentially hitting all targets in its path until it reaches maximum
range.
{{
    if you.race() == "Kobold" or you.race() == "Spriggan" then
        return "Unfortunately, it is too long and awkward for you to use."
    end
}}

items.large rock:
A very large and very heavy stone. {{
    if you.race() == "Ogre"
       or you.race() == "Troll"
   then
       return ""
   else
       return "Only large creatures are capable of throwing it."
   end
}}

skills.invocations:
Your Invocations skill affects the likelihood that an attempt to use divine
abilities with certain gods will be successful, and often the power of such
abilities.

{{
    if you.race() ~= "Djinni" then
        return "The Invocations skill also affects your magical reserves, " ..
               "but to a lesser degree than the Spellcasting skill. Only the " ..
               "higher contribution is used."
    end
}}
